# panel fixture: after another step of the track is selected, the knob edits that step
# manual: p013, p015
# workflow: Step zoom, step attributes
# p013: a row 0 key switches the view to that step of the same track.
given step 3 5 pit = 0
given step 3 7 pit = 0
at 0 ms press mode.step
at 200 ms click step(3,5)
at 400 ms release mode.step
at 1000 ms click step(0,7)
expect commands 0
at 2000 ms turn edit.enc.pit 2
expect command SetStep track=3 step=6 attr=PitchOffset value=2
expect commands 1
expect engine step 3 7 pit = 2
expect engine step 3 5 pit = 0
